# The instance's own ntfy server (ADR-391), appended to Caddyfile.template by
# scripts/install/compose.py::render_caddyfile when the operator runs it. The
# site's name below is an installer placeholder (string.Template), not Caddy
# syntax. Caddy flushes ntfy's streamed subscriptions as they come and carries
# its WebSockets: the server needs nothing more than the proxy itself.
$NTFY_DOMAIN {
	reverse_proxy ntfy:80
}
